          "id": "xdatD",
          "name": "PeriodYear",
          "fill": "#666666",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "618 — 907 年",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wKKzA",
          "name": "Desc1",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "唐代笙得到空前发展，出现多种形制和演奏名家。燕乐中大量使用笙，笙在宫廷乐队和民间演奏中皆有广泛应用。唐代文献中有大量关于笙的记载，笙曲目丰富，演奏技法日臻成熟，是笙艺术发展的黄金时期。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rEmsS",
          "name": "Desc2",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "目前已知最早的笙实物为曾侯乙墓出土的14管笙，距今已有2400余年历史。其制作工艺精湛，管身排列有序，簧片结构完整，充分展示了古代笙的制作水平。唐代笙在此基础上继续发展，形制更加多样。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "z93Wn",
          "name": "Image Frame — pic/2-敦煌.png",
