          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "十三簧",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u3Maq",
          "name": "PeriodYear",
          "fill": "#666666",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1368 — 1644 年",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "q4mxjm",
          "name": "Desc1",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "明代笙发展为十三簧，音域大幅扩展，表现力显著增强。十三簧的配置使笙能够演奏更加复杂的旋律与丰富的和声，成为明代宫廷音乐和民间戏曲中不可或缺的核心乐器。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mTc1w",
          "name": "Desc2",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "明代文献中有大量关于笙的记载，《明会典》《乐律全书》等典籍详细记录了笙的形制与演奏规范。明代的十三簧笙在制作工艺上达到了前所未有的高度，各地形成了不同风格的制笙流派，笙的形制逐渐定型，为现代笙的发展奠定了坚实基础。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
